  "turkish_executive_summary": "SPRINT 09.41 Y\u00d6NET\u0130C\u0130 \u00d6ZET\u0130:\n1. \u00c7oklu Enstr\u00fcman Otantik Veri Tamamlama:\n   - BTC, ETH ve SOL i\u00e7in 14 ayl\u0131k (Ocak 2024 - \u015eubat 2025) eksiksiz veri taban\u0131 kurulmu\u015ftur: Her enstr\u00fcman i\u00e7in 40.800 adet 15m Spot bar\u0131, 40.800 adet 15m Vadeli i\u015flem bar\u0131, 40.800 adet 15m G\u00f6sterge fiyat\u0131 (Mark Price) bar\u0131, 40.800 adet Spot/Perp baz bar\u0131 ve 1.275 fonlama uzla\u015fmas\u0131 Binance Data Vision resmi ar\u015fivlerinden indirilerek SHA-256 ile %100 do\u011frulanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.\n2. Sprint 09.40 \u0130ddialar\u0131n\u0131n ve Likidasyon Muhasebesinin D\u00fczeltilmesi:\n   - Sprint 09.40'taki '-5.000 USDT likidasyon zarar\u0131' basitle\u015ftirmesi resmi olarak d\u00fczeltilmi\u015ftir. Vadeli k\u0131sa pozisyon tasfiye oldu\u011funda, Spot c\u00fczdandaki BTC (+10.450 USDT de\u011ferinde) a\u00e7\u0131k kalmaktad\u0131r. Tasfiye an\u0131nda portf\u00f6y \u00f6zkayna\u011f\u0131 +10.450 USDT olup, vade sonuna kadar \u00e7\u0131plak tutuldu\u011funda net P&L -31,67 USDT (% -0,32), tasfiye an\u0131nda kapat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ise +444,36 USDT (% +4,44)'t\u00fcr. -5.000 USDT'lik zarar iddias\u0131 geri \u00e7ekilmi\u015ftir.\n3. Pasif Carry Benchmarklar\u0131 (Yap\u0131 A ve Yap\u0131 B):\n   - Yap\u0131 A (5.000 Spot / 2.500 Marjin / 2.500 Nakit): Net y\u0131ll\u0131kland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f getiri BTC %5,38, ETH %5,82, SOL %5,61. Ancak 2.500 USDT'lik nakit tamponu BTC'nin 109k rallisinde tamamen t\u00fckenmi\u015f, Spot k\u00e2r\u0131ndan ek aktar\u0131m gerekmi\u015ftir.\n   - Yap\u0131 B (2.500 Spot / 1.250 Marjin / 6.250 Nakit): Hi\u00e7bir marjin stresi ya\u015famadan ralliye dayanm\u0131\u015f, ancak y\u0131ll\u0131k net getiri %2,69 - %2,91 seviyesine gerilemi\u015ftir.\n4. Portf\u00f6y Marjini (Portfolio Margin) Fizibilitesi:\n   - \u00c7apraz teminatl\u0131 portf\u00f6y marjini, Spot varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 teminat havuzuna (%5-%10 kesinti/haircut ile) dahil etti\u011fi i\u00e7in bo\u011fa rallilerinde izole marjinin ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 c\u00fczdan ayr\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 tasfiyesini operasyonel olarak ortadan kald\u0131r\u0131r. Resmi s\u00f6zle\u015fme do\u011frulamas\u0131 yap\u0131lana kadar bu model HYPOTHETICAL_PORTFOLIO_MARGIN olarak s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.\n5. Risksiz Hazine Bonosu Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131:\n   - 2024 y\u0131l\u0131nda 3 ayl\u0131k ABD Hazine Bonosu risksiz %5,25 getiri (+611 USDT) \u00fcretmi\u015ftir. Tamamen g\u00fcvenli carry (Yap\u0131 B) yaln\u0131zca +326 ila +339 USDT \u00fcreterek bononun yar\u0131s\u0131 kadar getiri sa\u011flam\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Marjin riski alan Yap\u0131 A ise (+626 ila +677 USDT) bonoya g\u00f6re 14 ayda sadece +15 ila +66 USDT (< %0,5 prim) \u00fcretebilmi\u015ftir. Borsa kar\u015f\u0131 taraf, ak\u0131ll\u0131 s\u00f6zle\u015fme ve operasyonel tasfiye riskleri hesaba kat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda strateji kurumsal sermaye i\u00e7in cazip de\u011fildir.\n6. Karar Kap\u0131s\u0131: EXPLORATORY_ECONOMIC_FEASIBILITY. APPROVAL4 = FALSE korunmaktad\u0131r."
